Create an infographic in Figma explaining the concept of Public Land Mobile
Network (PLMN).
Aim: To create an infographic explaining the concept of Public Land Mobile Network using Figma.
Procedure:
1. Open Figma and create a new infographic design.
2. Add the title “Public Land Mobile Network.”
3. Include mobile stations, base stations, and the core network.
4. Use icons and arrows to show network connections.
5. Add short descriptions explaining the purpose of each component.
Output Design: An infographic illustrating the components and working of a PLMN.
Result: A clear and informative PLMN infographic was created successfully using Figma.
